# launchd plist for the local llama-server — machine-specific operator
# config, not a repo artifact (binding-sprint territory). Kept in the
# working tree but out of commits. (routing-profiles/ IS tracked — it is
# Phase 6 /context measurement substrate and binding-sprint reference.)
scripts/com.grove.llama-server.plist
docs/sprints/

# repo-write-containment-v1 P3 — untracked runtime/build litter kept out of
# commits and off the (now read-only) repo tree. *.egg-info generalizes the
# existing hermes_agent.egg-info rule to cover hermes_autonomaton.egg-info too;
# graphify-out/ is graphify build cache; raw/ and research/ are transient
# agent/standards staging (the GRV standards live canonically in
# docs/standards/grv/ and the cellar).
graphify-out/
*.egg-info/
raw/
research/
